{
    "title": "Music Night Battle: Beat Music",
    "description": "<b>Music Night Battle: Beat Music is an amazing music battle game, feel the song with your heart, and dance to rhythm with your fingers! </b> When the falling arrow reaches four scoring area, follow the rhythm and quickly click to defeat opponents. In Music Night Battle, you can select of songs and characters to play in freeplay mode, challenge higher ratings; \r\n\r\n<b>Music Night Battle can bring you a stunning audiovisual gaming experience, quickly get started and become addicted to it.</b> Just click on the four arrow buttons on the screen to capture the beat and score, the sound effect and vibration are very intense. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 <b>Start easily </b>\r\n* Listen to the rhythm and observe the falling arrows reaches the scoring area\r\n* Click on the circle of short arrow, or long press of long arrow\r\n* Avoiding clicking on transparent arrows\r\n* Complete one level in story mode to unlock the next level\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfbc <b>Shocking experience </b>\r\n* Plot of the story mode is immersive\r\n* Cool retro cyberpunk art style\r\n* Perfect coordination of ears, eyes, and hands, become a rhythm master\r\n\r\nMusic Night : Beat Battle is a very exciting music rhythm game, with four simple buttons that can generate unlimited possibilities along with the music. \r\nAre you ready to welcome this exciting music night? Up, Down, Left and Right, follow the rhythm, fight till the last minute.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Music Night Battle: Beat Music is an amazing music battle game, feel the song with your heart, and dance to rhythm with your fingers! </b> When the falling arrow reaches four scoring area, follow the rhythm and quickly click to defeat opponents. In Music Night Battle, you can select of songs and characters to play in freeplay mode, challenge higher ratings; <br><br><b>Music Night Battle can bring you a stunning audiovisual gaming experience, quickly get started and become addicted to it.</b> Just click on the four arrow buttons on the screen to capture the beat and score, the sound effect and vibration are very intense. <br><br>\ud83c\udfb6 <b>Start easily </b><br>* Listen to the rhythm and observe the falling arrows reaches the scoring area<br>* Click on the circle of short arrow, or long press of long arrow<br>* Avoiding clicking on transparent arrows<br>* Complete one level in story mode to unlock the next level<br><br>\ud83c\udfbc <b>Shocking experience </b><br>* Plot of the story mode is immersive<br>* Cool retro cyberpunk art style<br>* Perfect coordination of ears, eyes, and hands, become a rhythm master<br><br>Music Night : Beat Battle is a very exciting music rhythm game, with four simple buttons that can generate unlimited possibilities along with the music. <br>Are you ready to welcome this exciting music night? Up, Down, Left and Right, follow the rhythm, fight till the last minute.",
